    "title": "89-year-old man feared missing in Fox River near Algonquin found safe on land - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ABC7 Chicago Digital Team ,\n6 hours ago\nA man feared missing in the Fox River near Algonquin was reported safe on land.\nFamily members say the 89-year-old man's medical alert device fell out of his pocket earlier Wednesday while he was on a boat, triggering an emergency response.\nABC7 Chicago is now streaming 24/7. Click here to watch Crews were searching in the Fox River in the north suburbs Wednesday.\nThe search was happening near Arthur Road in Algonquin, police said.\nChopper 7 was over the scene. A diver could be seen in the water.\n7",
